        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 7,
      "label": "s1_side02_0000_camera_06",
      "hash64": "EFBD27B47EB4A0C1",
      "text": "Me llamo Gama. Soy una viajera a la que le gusta\\nla fotografía un poco mucho.[VAR 0x0114(0046)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 77,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0046"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 8,
      "label": "s1_side02_0000_camera_07",
      "hash64": "EFBD26B47EB49F0E",
      "text": "Este de aquí es Growlithe, mi compañero.\\n¿No te parece adorable su cuernecillo?[VAR 0x0114(0046)]",
      "flags": 4,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 79,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0046"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 9,
      "label": "s1_side02_0000_dog_01",
      "hash64": "89D356223DEC9CE1",
      "text": "¡Grooow!",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 10,
      "label": "s1_side02_0000_camera_08",
      "hash64": "EFBD21B47EB4968F",
      "text": "Por cierto, sé que no viene a cuento de nada,\\n¿pero podría sacarte una foto?[VAR 0x0114(0046)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 76,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0046"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 11,
      "label": "s1_side02_0000_camera_09",
      "hash64": "EFBD20B47EB494DC",
      "text": "¡Pero bueno, chiqui! ¿Vas a dejar que una extraña\\na la que no conoces de nada te haga una foto?[VAR 0x0114(0046)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 95,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0046"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 12,
      "label": "s1_side02_0000_camera_10",
      "hash64": "EFB9A3B47EB18A9E",
      "text": "Bueno, no seré yo quien te diga que no.[VAR 0x0114(0046)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 39,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0046"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 13,
      "label": "s1_side02_0000_camera_11",
      "hash64": "EFB9A4B47EB18C51",
      "text": "Pues haces bien, la verdad.\\c\\n¡No debes fiarte de una persona a la que acabas\\nde conocer así como si nada, chiqui![VAR 0x0114(0046)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 27,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE01",
          "args_hex": []
